#: mason/tools/high_dimensional_phenotypes/upload_high_dim_spreadsheet_dialogs.mas:51
msgctxt "phenotype.the_samples_for_which_you_are_uploading_high_dimensional_phenotypes"
msgid "The samples for which you are uploading high-dimensional phenotypes must exist in the database already. They can be field trial entities such as plot names, plant names, and tissue sample names. They can be genotyping plate well tissue sample names. They can also be sample names from a sampling trial in the database."
